<title>ITALY: Italy coalition parties to meet Weds over budget.</title>
<headline>Italy coalition parties to meet Weds over budget.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Minister Romano Prodi will meet representatives of coalition parties on Wednesday morning to discuss the forthcoming mini-budget, political sources said.</p>
<p>Prodi is expected to meet union leaders in the afternoon for more budget talks, the sources added.</p>
<p>The mini-budget, which will include up to 16 trillion lire of deficit cutting measures, is due to be unveiled before the end of the week. -- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
